msgid ""
"Add synthesizing italic and bold. We cannot disable these right now, but "
"that was also the case with the previous text layout, and synthesizing "
"italics and bolds is very important for East-Asian fonts. ([Bug 465886]"
"(https://bugs.kde.org/show_bug.cgi?id=465886))"
msgstr ""
"Aldonu sintezan kursivan kaj grasan. Ni ne povas malŝalti tiujn ĉi nun, sed "
