"(https://bugs.kde.org/show_bug.cgi?id=465886))"

#: content/en/posts/2023/second-beta-for-krita-5-2-0-released.md:17
msgid ""
"svgtexttool: Disable Shift+Enter soft line breaks ([Bug 472743](https://bugs."
"kde.org/show_bug.cgi?id=472743))"
msgstr ""
"svgtexttool: Malebligu Shift+Enigu molajn linio-rompojn ([Bug 472743]"
"(https://bugs.kde.org/show_bug.cgi?id=472743))"

