"([kunfandpeto, Sharaf Zaman](https://invent.kde.org/graphics/krita/-/"
"merge_requests/2131))"

#: content/en/posts/2024/monthly-update-15.md:99
msgid ""
"**Brush Presets** - Speedup loading of GBR brushtips, and brush presets with "
"embedded resources. ([merge request, Dmitry Kazakov](https://invent.kde.org/"
"graphics/krita/-/merge_requests/2112))"
msgstr ""
