#: content/en/posts/2024/monthly-update-15.md:100
msgid ""
"**Brush Engines** - Fix animated brushtips' sequence order in the Pixel "
"Engine. This also introduces a small change to Color Smudge animated "
"brushtips, where the first dab is now used for getting smudge information "
"instead of painting. ([merge request, Dmitry Kazakov](https://invent.kde.org/"
"graphics/krita/-/merge_requests/2116))"
msgstr ""

#: content/en/posts/2024/monthly-update-15.md:101
msgid ""
"**Color Sampler** - Don't reset redo when doing color picking. ([BUG:485910]"
"(https://bugs.kde.org/485910))([merge request, Dmitry Kazakov](https://"
"invent.kde.org/graphics/krita/-/merge_requests/2133))"
msgstr ""
