#: content/en/posts/2024/monthly-update-15.md:109
msgid ""
"**Layer Stack** - Fix wrong layer being active on opening document. In the "
"case of single-layer documents, no layer was active, which caused crashes "
"under some circumstances. ([BUG:480718](https://bugs.kde.org/480718)) "
"([merge request, Dmitry Kazakov](https://invent.kde.org/graphics/krita/-/"
"merge_requests/2115/))"
msgstr ""
"**Tavola Stako** - Ripari malĝustan tavolon aktivantan dum malfermado de "
"dokumento. En la kazo de unutavolaj dokumentoj, neniu tavolo estis aktiva, "
"kio kaŭzis paneojn en iuj cirkonstancoj. ([BUG:480718](https://bugs.kde."
"org/480718)) ([kunfandpeto, Dmitry Kazakov](https://invent.kde.org/graphics/"
"krita/-/merge_requests/2115/) )"

#: content/en/posts/2024/monthly-update-15.md:115
msgid "**Features:**"
msgstr "**Trajtoj:**"

#: content/en/posts/2024/monthly-update-15.md:117
msgid ""
"**Toolbars, Shortcuts** - Add Docker Box action that shows a docker in a "
"temporary box, which can be added to a toolbar or assigned to shortcut. "
"([merge request, Freya Lupen](https://invent.kde.org/graphics/krita/-/"
"merge_requests/2104))"
msgstr ""
"**Ilbretoj, Ŝparvojoj** - Aldonu Docker Box-ago, kiu montras docker en "
"provizora skatolo, kiu povas esti aldonita al ilobreto aŭ asignita al "
"ŝparvojo. ([kunfandpeto, Freya Lupen](https://invent.kde.org/graphics/"
"krita/-/merge_requests/2104))"

#: content/en/posts/2024/monthly-update-15.md:118
msgid ""
"**Canvas Input Shortcuts** - Add new Tool Invocation action, \"Activate with "
"Other Color\". This can be bound to a key+mousebutton, where holding those "
"keys will cause, for instance, the Freehand Brush to paint with the "
"background instead of foreground color. ([merge request, ziplantil](https://"
"invent.kde.org/graphics/krita/-/merge_requests/2105))"
msgstr ""

#: content/en/posts/2024/monthly-update-15.md:122
msgid ""
"**Fill Tools** - Improve performance of fill tools, so that time taken "
"depends on fill size and not image size. Filling also now starts on mouse-"
"press and not mouse-release. ([merge request, Deif Lou](https://invent.kde."
"org/graphics/krita/-/merge_requests/2125))"
msgstr ""
"** Plenigaj iloj ** - Plibonigu rendimenton de plenigaj iloj, tiel ke la "
"tempo okupita dependas de pleniggrando kaj ne de bildgrandeco. Plenigado "
"ankaŭ nun komenciĝas per mus-premo kaj ne mus-liberigo. ([kunfandpeto, Deif "
"Lou](https://invent.kde.org/graphics/krita/-/merge_requests/2125))"

#: content/en/posts/2024/monthly-update-15.md:123
msgid ""
"**Brush Engines** - Fix assert on selecting RGBA brushes in incorrect "
"format. ([BUG:484115](https://bugs.kde.org/484115)) ([commit, Agata Cacko]"
"(https://invent.kde.org/graphics/krita/-/"
"commit/13fe82adbb67fa3234ff9bbfb1ba2a7820b099fe))"
msgstr ""
"**Brush Engines** - Ripari aserton pri elekto de RGBA-brosoj en malĝusta "
"formato. ([BUG:484115](https://bugs.kde.org/484115)) ([commit, Agata Cacko]"
"(https://invent.kde.org/graphics/krita/-/"
"commit/13fe82adbb67fa3234ff9bbfb1ba2a7820b099fe))"

#: content/en/posts/2024/monthly-update-15.md:124
msgid ""
"**Transform Tool** - Fix free transform inverted rotation when flipped over "
"in perspective. ([merge request, Stuffins](https://invent.kde.org/graphics/"
"krita/-/merge_requests/2114))"
msgstr ""
"**Transforma Ilo** - Ripari liberan transformitan inversan rotacion kiam "
